Z||000000||2birds||11-29-2001||10:24 PM||||It's official.  I'm transferring to Memphis (actually Millington) TN in January.  No more sea duty for a while.  Thanks to those who gave me some info on the area.  Looking forward to seeing some different Fieros for a change.||||reg||10
